    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "11. A) Innovate technologies to ensure the safety of users' accounts.\nB) Provide incentives for the application of creative passwords.\nC) Explore the possibility of using simpler secret codes.\nD) Take steps to encourage users to log in more often.",
